.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-REVEAL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-reveal
.Nd check a file against a commitment
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis reveal
.Ar dir file salt
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm noqtis reveal
computes the commitment of
.Ar file
under the salt in the file
.Ar salt
.Pq Xr noqtis-commit 1
and compares it, in constant time, with every commitment in the data
record of
.Ar dir .
Check the capsule first
.Pq Xr noqtis-check 1 :
the commitment counts only if the record is the one sealed.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
the file matches a commitment (its number is printed)
.It 1
it matches none: the file or the salt is not the one committed to
.It 2
a usage or file error
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis-commit 1 ,
.Xr nqdcommit 3
